--
Sign in to Claude, ChatGPT, Antigravity or an API key.

Usage: wisp login WHAT

WHAT is one of:
  claude         a Claude Pro or Max subscription
  chatgpt        a ChatGPT Plus or Pro subscription
  antigravity    an Antigravity Gemini subscription
  key            an API key: Claude, OpenAI, Gemini or a gateway
  NAME           one of your accounts, to sign in to it again; a new name adds an account with that name
Leave it out and wisp asks.

For scripts:
  --name NAME     the new account's name; skips the name question
  -h, --help      show this help

--
Show your accounts and what needs you.

Usage: wisp status NAME

NAME is one of your accounts; leave it out to see all of them.
wisp login status does the same.

  -h, --help      show this help

--
  1  claude-subscription   Claude subscription · new chats start here
  2  claude-work           Claude subscription
  3  chatgpt               ChatGPT subscription
  4  claude-api            Claude API · from ~/.config/wisp/.env
  5  all

--
  1  ● claude-subscription   Claude subscription · new chats start here
  2  ● claude-work           Claude subscription
  3  ● chatgpt               ChatGPT subscription
  4  ● claude-api            Claude API · from ~/.config/wisp/.env
  5  all
enter choose · esc cancel
